            "target_entity_instance": "Southern Ocean",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "In order to take account of the eddy contributions and to remove spurious circulations, such as the Deacon cell in the Southern Ocean, the global and Pacific MOCs are evaluated on the potential density coordinate (Fig. S3).",
